.TH turev n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::turev
.PP
\fBrev\fR\-like reversal of the characters within each line (pure Tcl, Unicode by code point).
.SS API
.CS
::tclutils::turev::line str
::tclutils::turev::text text
::tclutils::turev::file path
.CE
.PP
A trailing newline is preserved.
.SS CLI
.CS
tclsh bin/turev.tcl file.txt
.CE
